  "description": "MmsCore.Calendar provides a business calendar that excludes holidays and specific dates. It offers features to exclude weekdays or weekends, add specific excluded dates, get the next or previous business day, calculate the number of business days within a specified period, and get the date after a specified number of business days. This allows users to customise the calendar according to their business needs.",
